### Short bio

I started my first business at 17 and spent the next 28 years building and running multiple service and retail businesses. I have been coaching business owners for 17 years. Four years running, 2015 to 2018, I was ranked the world's number one business coach. At Business Coach Academy I worked with over 250 coaches, helping them grow their practices and get real results for their clients. I now work with Yorkshire business owners who are brilliant at what they do but want more profit, more control, and more of their life back.

### One-line introduction

Pam Woodford is a four-time world number one ranked business coach with 43 years of business experience, who helps Yorkshire owner-led businesses grow profit and get their owners out of the weeds.

### For partners and events

Pam Woodford started her first business at 17 and spent 28 years building and running multiple service and retail businesses before moving into coaching. She has coached business owners for 17 years and was ranked the world's number one business coach four years in a row, from 2015 to 2018. At Business Coach Academy, she worked with over 250 licensed coaches, guiding them to grow their practices and deliver results for clients. She now works with Yorkshire owner-led businesses, helping owners grow profit, build teams that perform without them, and get more from the business they have already built.

