### Headline

**Headline**

```text
Helping Yorkshire business owners get more profit and more of their life back | 43 years in business | Ranked world's #1 business coach 4 years running | Take the free 3-min BOSS Scorecard
```

### About

**About section**

```text
Be honest.

Do you ever look at your business and think: "I should have more to show for all this ruddy effort"?

You've got customers. You've got a team. Turnover looks decent enough from the outside.

But behind the scenes it often feels like:

- Ridiculous hours that never seem to ease
- Every problem landing on your desk because nobody else sorts it
- Margin that disappears between winning the job and finishing it
- A bank account at month-end that doesn't match the turnover you're putting through

Not enough juice for the squeeze. That's what most owners tell me, once they actually say it out loud.

WHAT MOST OWNERS ACTUALLY WANT

A business that makes proper profit without needing you in the middle of everything.

Marketing that brings in the right work consistently.
Sales conversations that convert at the right margin.
A team that owns their patch and solves problems instead of bringing them to you.

When those three things work properly, profit improves and running the business feels worth the effort you're putting in.

WHO THIS IS FOR

Business owners in Yorkshire who are brilliant at what they do but want more from the business they've already built.

Specifically, owners who:

- Feel like the business depends on them for too many decisions
- Have plenty of activity but profit feels tighter than it should
- Want a team that performs without them standing in the middle of it
- Are ready to get more profit, more control, and more of their time back

HOW I WORK WITH YOU

I've been in business since I was 17. Forty-three years building and running businesses across service and retail before I ever coached anyone. I know what a 6am plant breakdown feels like. That's not a metaphor.

I've coached business owners for 17 years. Four years running, 2015 to 2018, I was ranked the world's number one business coach across a global network.

The work starts with your numbers, not a generic playbook.

We look at five things: the leads coming in, how many convert, what each job or sale is worth, how often customers come back, and what's left as profit after the costs. A 10% shift on each of those compounds to around 61% more revenue. Most businesses have two or three of those levers sitting half-open.

The BOSS Scorecard takes three minutes and shows exactly which part of your business is capping your profit right now. That's where we start.

PROOF

Ranked world's number one business coach four consecutive years: 2015, 2016, 2017 and 2018.

