```text
Right, so we've looked at where the margin's going, why the cash feels tighter than the turnover suggests, and what it would mean to have a team that stops landing everything on your desk. The work starts with your BOSS Scorecard so we know exactly where to go first, then we meet weekly for the first five or six weeks to get some quick wins in and build momentum, then twice a month from there. You can start on the monthly rate at £1,450, or if you want to commit to six months and save yourself a month's cost, that's £7,800 and we can split that if the timing is better. Both routes get you the same work and the same access to me. Which one suits where you are right now?
```

_Deliver this after you have summarised what you heard on the call. Name their specific problem back to them first, then present the two options. Do not present three options at once. Let the silence sit after the question._

