Pam started her first business at 17 and spent 28 years building and running multiple service and retail businesses before she coached anyone. She has been coaching business owners for 17 years and was ranked the world's number one business coach four years in a row: 2015, 2016, 2017 and 2018. That ranking was measured on client results and business growth delivered, not a vote or a self-nomination. She has spent over 8 years working specifically with MDs in construction and allied trades, which means she understands 90-day payment terms, main contractor pressure, rework costs, and what it means to price a job wrong and spend six months working for nothing. [Add one specific client result here: business type, what changed, from where to where, and how long it took. This is the single line that turns a sceptical MD from interested to ready to go.]

